      {
        "heading": "Who and what are the main buyers and markets this year?",
        "body": "The Department of Veterans Affairs accounted for $89.1M of obligations in FY2027 to date. The Medical, Dental, and Hospital Equipment and Supplies Merchant Wholesalers market accounted for $91.1M in FY2027 to date, while Surgical and Medical Instrument Manufacturing accounted for $573K and General Medical and Surgical Hospitals accounted for $10K."
